   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guttmacher I. SRHR study - AGI SRHR studies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for ensuring SRHR for young people in Guatemala, Honduras and Nicaragua. The goal of the project is to identify and document the key SRH needs of adolescents in the three mentioned countries and in the Central American region as a whole and to effectively comunicate these findings to a wide range of stakeholders, in order to improve the provision of information and services to young people.</narrative>
